## Summary

Recreates the closed #5099 Archive-folder fallback feature after the July 23 repository cleanup wiped old PR refs/diffs. The branch restores the prompt/create flow plus explicit folder-list refresh after Archive creation.

Review follow-up in `2e9637cf` makes the asynchronous fallback account-safe across both the sidebar and Email Library:

- captures and freezes the account ID, source folder, and UID when the action starts;
- keys/deduplicates the setup prompt per account;
- passes the captured account through Archive creation, folder refresh, and retry;
- aborts stale work when the active account changes and prevents stale sidebar/card/bulk UI mutation;
- replaces the sidebar's undefined `_loadFolders()` call with its real captured-account refresh path;
- adds Node-driven regressions, including switching accounts while the confirmation is pending.
